\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces One transaction on the shared lane. (a) Admission reserves one all-fail recovery per TB and rejects TB5; the 45\nonbreakingspace ms batch deletes two debts in one generation. (b) The verifier commits the 128-token AI lease and keeps $X_t$ for the 256-token AI lease, whose last recovery would end after the guard. AI units are Qwen prefill requests; hatching marks the 5\nonbreakingspace ms launch-control charge.}}{8}{figure.caption.14}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:atomic-replan}{{5}{8}{One transaction on the shared lane. (a) Admission reserves one all-fail recovery per TB and rejects TB5; the 45~ms batch deletes two debts in one generation. (b) The verifier commits the 128-token AI lease and keeps $X_t$ for the 256-token AI lease, whose last recovery would end after the guard. AI units are Qwen prefill requests; hatching marks the 5~ms launch-control charge}{figure.caption.14}{}}
