\newlabel{fig:refinement}{{6}{9}{Refinement of one AI lease. Black steps: commit with a latest-start (1), run request (2), launch gate and launch marker (3), CUDA event and completion marker (4), and retirement on a matching marker (5). Red faults: marker reconciliation after a late reply (1), AI quarantine after channel loss (2), and no-op outcome and response replays (3, 4)}{figure.caption.17}{}}
